    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an easy-to-pick up, hard-to-put down game focused on the action of mining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Be sure to add it to your wishlist \u2014 you\u2019ll get a notification when it\u2019s released!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes you on an adventure across a variety of regions inspired by the real-world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From frozen mountains and arid deserts to mysterious jungles and the iconic cityscape of Paris, each location offers unique ores, environmental challenges, and secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only your trusty pickaxe in hand, you'll travel the world in search of treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the thrill of discovery and excavation in MINE THE WORLD's global mining adventure.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an easy-to-pick up, hard-to-put down game focused on the action of mining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Be sure to add it to your wishlist \u2014 you\u2019ll get a notification when it\u2019s released!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes you on an adventure across a variety of regions inspired by the real-world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From frozen mountains and arid deserts to mysterious jungles and the iconic cityscape of Paris, each location offers unique ores, environmental challenges, and secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only your trusty pickaxe in hand, you'll travel the world in search of treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the thrill of discovery and excavation in MINE THE WORLD's global mining adventure.</p>",
    "short_description": "Brilliantcrypto presents this brand-new mining spin-off. Travel the world chasing hidden treasures and precious gemstones, in this worldwide mining adventure!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Spanish - Spain, Indonesian, Vietnamese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
